  II.\n\nOrganisation: Foresight Institute\nLocation: Remote (global\; hubs
  in San Francisco and Berlin)\nAward: Typically $30\,000 to $100\,000 per 
 grant\, with smaller amounts for the Human Empowerment and AI Insurance & 
 Open Governance focus areas and higher amounts for the rest (larger possib
 le for the right project)\, plus private local compute and workspace at th
 e San Francisco or Berlin AI Nodes. No application fee.\nDuration: Project
 -based\n\nMore: https://foresight.org/grants/ai-science-safety-nodes-rfp/?
 utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
